cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "Jev Scope Challenge: an exploratory decision-reliability research series"
message: >-
  Cite the relevant study and exact Git commit when using this repository.
  Also credit Kev, Qwen and other upstream work used in that study; see
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. This is research software with exploratory results,
  not a published or peer-reviewed paper.
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Yuchi
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yuchi-Wang02/jev-scope-challenge"
url: "https://github.com/Yuchi-Wang02/jev-scope-challenge"
abstract: >-
  Controlled synthetic studies of scope, input representation, evidence
  sufficiency and fact extraction in typed model decisions. Includes a Jev API
  comparison and subsequent historical Kev/Qwen diagnostics with frozen inputs,
  raw records, offline verification and explicit human-review limitations.
keywords:
  - model evaluation
  - decision reliability
  - evidence sufficiency
  - fact extraction
